        "label": "Normal Force Equation",
        "highlight": null,
        "step_number": null,
        "explanation": "From horizontal equilibrium: $N \\sin\\theta = ma \\implies N = \\frac{ma}{\\sin\\theta}$",
        "left_title": null,
